{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261126/photo/bkn-20261126171704257-1126_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261126191258\"/><p>鋁窗砸地粉碎。</p><p>今日(26日)下午3時50分，深水埗福榮街90號一大廈有鋁窗飛墮馬路，幸好無砸中途經車輛或行人。涉事鋁窗的鋁框扭曲斷裂，周圍散落玻璃碎片，警員圍封現場調查後，以涉嫌「容許物件從高處墮下」拘捕一名男子。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T11:43:58.929329+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":116,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T09:17:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T14:37:17.684968+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T11:37:19.650234+00:00","content_hash":"bbffbcc7dbe81705f44d8faecc05985004fa24c29c385b6329c11cd51507f988","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-26T11:43:58.929329+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}